## 🔒 2. The Four Scanning Layers

CYPHEX uses **four independent scanning engines** that work together to achieve maximum vulnerability coverage. No single tool can catch everything — this layered approach ensures nothing slips through.

```mermaid
graph LR
    subgraph STATIC["🔍 STATIC ANALYSIS (Code at Rest)"]
        direction TB
        L1["🧩 Layer 1: Cyphex SAST<br/>Custom regex patterns<br/>20+ languages · P0-P3 tiers"]
        L2["🛡️ Layer 2: Semgrep SAST<br/>5,000+ community rules<br/>via WSL on Windows"]
    end

    subgraph DYNAMIC["💥 DYNAMIC ANALYSIS (App Running)"]
        direction TB
        L3["🤖 Layer 3: Cyphex DAST<br/>14 AI-powered agents<br/>Custom exploit logic"]
        L4["🎯 Layer 4: Nuclei DAST<br/>8,000+ templates<br/>CVE & misconfiguration"]
    end

    SRC["📂 Source Code"] --> L1
    SRC --> L2
    SANDBOX["📦 Running Sandbox"] --> L3
    SANDBOX --> L4

    L1 --> MERGE["🔀 Merged Findings"]
    L2 --> MERGE
    L3 --> MERGE
    L4 --> MERGE
    MERGE --> COUNCIL["🧠 AI Council"]
```

