| 2️⃣ | **Semgrep SAST** | Static | 5,000+ professional rules with semantic analysis (via WSL on Windows) | ⚡ Fast |
| 3️⃣ | **Cyphex DAST** | Dynamic | 14 autonomous AI agents crawling, fuzzing, exploiting the live sandbox | 🕐 Medium |
| 4️⃣ | **Nuclei DAST** | Dynamic | 8,000+ templates covering CVEs, exposures, misconfigurations | 🕐 Medium |

