## 🧬 5. Adversarial Immune System

Instead of hardcoded WAF rules, CYPHEX uses a **genetic algorithm** to evolve its own attack detection DNA. A Red Team AI and Blue Team AI battle each other across generations to converge on the mathematical signature of malicious input.

```mermaid
graph LR
    subgraph GENOME["🧬 Behavioral Genome Engine"]
        direction TB
        BUILD["📊 Build Endpoint Profiles<br/>from scan context"]
        FV["📐 15-Dimension Feature Vector<br/>Entropy · Special chars · Keywords<br/>URL encoding · Traversal depth<br/>Bracket imbalance · Unicode ratio"]
        BUILD --> FV
    end

    subgraph EVOLUTION["🔄 Co-Evolution Loop"]
        direction TB
        RED["🔴 Red Team AI<br/>Mutation Engine<br/>Generates obfuscated payloads"]
        BLUE["🔵 Blue Team AI<br/>Genome Classifier<br/>Evolves detection thresholds"]
        RED -->|"Attack 🗡️"| BLUE
        BLUE -->|"Adapt 🛡️"| RED
    end

    subgraph RESULT["✅ Converged Output"]
        direction TB
        WAF["🛡️ Hardened WAF Profile<br/>Mathematical attack signature"]
        SCORE["📊 Genome Scoring Table<br/>Payload → Score → Verdict"]
    end

    FV --> RED
    FV --> BLUE
    BLUE --> WAF
    WAF --> SCORE
```

### Feature Vector (15 Dimensions)

| # | Feature | What It Measures |
|:---:|:---|:---|
| 0 | `input_length` | Total input length |
| 1 | `entropy` | Shannon entropy (randomness) |
| 2 | `special_char_ratio` | Ratio of `'";-<>` etc. |
| 3 | `url_encoding_ratio` | `%20`, `%27` density |
| 4 | `uppercase_ratio` | Unusual casing patterns |
| 5 | `digit_ratio` | Numeric content density |
| 6 | `max_token_length` | Longest single token |
| 7 | `keyword_score` | SQL/JS keyword matches |
| 8 | `sqli_pattern_score` | SQLi-specific signatures |
| 9 | `null_byte` | Null byte injection |
| 10 | `traversal_depth` | `../` depth |
| 11 | `bracket_imbalance` | Unmatched `()[]{}` |
| 12 | `unicode_ratio` | Exotic unicode density |
| 13 | `repetition_ratio` | Repeated char patterns |
| 14 | `token_count` | Total token count |

